1. e4 {[%eval +0.24][%brsp e5]}  g6 {[%eval +0.60][%brsp d4]A small surprise. Utut avoids his beloved Caro-Kann .}  
2. d4 {[%eval +0.59][%brsp Bg7]}  Bg7 {[%eval +0.71][%brsp Nc3]}  3. Nc3 {[%eval +0.60][%brsp d5]}  
c5 {[%eval +0.79][%brsp Be3]}  4. d5 {[%eval +0.66][%brsp d6]One of several good options. 4.Nf3 was well worth a thought against a player without much experience in the Dragon. Furthermore I had examined the dangerous line 4.dxc5 in some detail with Miss Antoaneta Stefanova some months earlier. However, such sharp variations did not suit my mood for the day.}  
